      "id": "claim_edbede94a65146e0b8ff99588e7e2922",
      "statement": "stream_chunk_timeout is a per-chunk wall-clock timeout for async streaming (default 120 seconds); it measures silence between parsed chunks (not inter-byte silence), and can be disabled via LANGCHAIN_OPENAI_STREAM_CHUNK_TIMEOUT_S environment variable.",
